<title>USA: SyQuest cuts EZFlyer price 20 pct.</title>
<headline>SyQuest cuts EZFlyer price 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc. Thursday said it cut the price of its EZFlyer 230 removable hard drive by 20 percent to $199.</p>
<p>The price is effective on Friday.</p>
</text>
